  "translation": [
    "Today is Sunday, and the weather is very nice. My friend Xiaoming and I went to play soccer. Although I don't play very well, I like playing very much. Xiaoming runs fast, and he plays the best. We happily played for an hour.",
    "After a while, the sky clouded over and it started to rain. Because the rain was heavy, we couldn't play any more. Xiaoming asked me, \"Shall we go home or go to a restaurant?\" I thought for a moment and said, \"Then let's go to a restaurant.\"",
    "At the restaurant, we ordered noodles and dumplings. Xiaoming ate a lot. He said with a smile, \"After playing soccer, the food tastes really good!\""
